    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Some insurers offer “No‑Claims Discount” (NCD) or “Claim‑Free Bonus” for customers who have not filed a claim in the past year, thereby reducing the premium.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Transporters should also be aware of the statutory requirement to maintain a valid insurance policy that covers the entire route, including any overnight stops. Failure to provide proof of insurance can result in penalties, seizure of the vehicle, or legal action.</p>
<p>By selecting the appropriate GST rate, choosing a reputable insurer, and ensuring all claim documentation is complete, both the transporter and the bike owner can minimize financial exposure and enjoy a smooth, hassle‑free journey from Hyderabad to Udupi.</p></div>
